## Embedded Lug

After completing this teaching, extract and append this lug to your `WAI-Lugs.jsonl`.
If `WAI-Lugs.jsonl` does not exist, create it with this lug as the first line:

```json
{"i":"teaching-track-encapsulation-v1","t":"Installed track encapsulation + historian + taste systems","ty":"signal","s":"c","ca":"2026-03-12T00:00:00Z","gb":"teaching-file","impact":8,"content":{"what":"Installed per-turn track capture, historian advisor, and taste preference files. Agent now records points each turn, supports resume/recovery from tracks, and will propose historian reviews at 30+ unreviewed points.","source":"track-encapsulation.md.teaching v1.0"},"_behavior_directive":{"what_this_is":"Record that this spoke has track encapsulation installed.","what_this_is_NOT":"An instruction to re-process this teaching."}}
```

