## Post-Completion

Move this file to the spoke's processed directory after successful processing.

Check which path exists (spokes vary):
- `seed/ingest/processed/` (v2 spokes) — use this if it exists
- `seed/processed/` (v1 spokes) — use this if `seed/ingest/processed/` does not exist
- If neither exists, create `seed/ingest/processed/` and use it
